# db/

Readable SQL migrations live here, as `migrations/NNNNN_snake_case.sql` with
a zero-padded sequential prefix, alongside `embed.go`, which embeds them
into the binary. Sequential prefixes rather than timestamps: generation must
produce byte-identical output on every machine.

The connection pool is implemented in `internal/platform/database/`.
Migration source and the embedded migration runner arrive in the next
database task; server startup never applies migrations implicitly.
